          "path": "macos/dotnet/zazzle-csharp-indexer/src/View/.dev/contracts.json",
          "entityId": "view-format"
        }
      ],
      "criteria": [
        "Usings collapse to one note, regions and logging disappear, and the remaining lines keep their source numbers",
        "A constructor that only assigns fields collapses to a note naming its parameters, with its doc comment; one with logic and a static one stay, and an empty one is noted as empty",
        "A catch that logs and rethrows collapses; one that returns a value stays",
        "Access modifiers go, var replaces only types spelled out on the right, and changed lines are marked N~",
        "The steps count what each rule changed, and a file with nothing to shorten comes back unchanged",
        "Logging is recognised on loggers, Debug, Trace and spans, and not when a statement increments or awaits or the receiver is not a logger; logging as an unbraced if body, or sharing a line with other code, stays",
        "Long locals get initials or three letters; only the local's own uses are renamed, not a field, member or parameter of the same name; clashes and keywords get a number, and a local used in nameof keeps its name"
      ],
